  "contentHtml": "<p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>증산작용 수업을 하면서 잎의 기공과 공변세포를 관찰하고 싶어 투명테이프를 활용하여 표본을 만들었습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>첫번째 사진이 나란한 잎을 가진 식물이고요,</p><p>두번째 사진은 이름모를 쌍떡잎 식물인데요</p><p>뭐가 기공이고 공변세포인지 모르겠어요 ㅠ</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fcf0a8534940c85e87d34a29cde4bf7c13891685\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fcf0a8534940c85e87d34a29cde4bf7c13891685\" data-origin-width=\"3000\" data-origin-height=\"4000\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7d671da799cd649b0a0de40d55a42a56ac95d4c3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7d671da799cd649b0a0de40d55a42a56ac95d4c3\" data-origin-width=\"3000\" data-origin-height=\"4000\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>모양이 넘 예쁘네요(?)</p><p>여기에서 기공이 보이시나요?</p><p>설마 저 무수히 많은 동그라미들이 기공일까요</p><p>.??</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fd1ba2ff1e9b431530a5eb765a9b319fa79c07c5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fd1ba2ff1e9b431530a5eb765a9b319fa79c07c5\" data-origin-width=\"3000\" data-origin-height=\"4000\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/748279065891777d25fb509589ccc45696d37f5f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/748279065891777d25fb509589ccc45696d37f5f\" data-origin-width=\"3000\" data-origin-height=\"4000\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>이건 두번째 식물인데요</p><p>여기에서는 군데군데 보이는 동그란 세포들을 공변세포라고 하면 될까요??</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>조언부탁드려요 ㅠㅠ</p><p>타전공 실험이 너무 어렵네요</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
